  "f3": {
   "text": "원본 127.29~145.33 'First, we start with Wisconsin milk. Make our own fresh cheese in-house. Shred just a little bit into a cookie cutter mold. Pop it in the oven and that is it. … It's just the cheese.' · 화면 134~145 시연",
   "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EI9C5IHWdYk&t=127s",
